++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

This tool calculates ya the Cylinders, Sectors, Heads or Capacity of any
drive. (Floppy, Harddisk, CD-Rom)

This tool works with four informations : Cylinders (on floppy 79)
					 Sectors   (on floppy 11)
					 Head      (on floppy  2)
                                         Capacity  (on floppy 890K)

To get ONE value calculated you must have the other THREE values !

i.e. you have a Harddrive encoding method is MFM and you need to know
     the capacity :

How many Cylinders ? 733
How many Heads     ? 7
How many Sectors   ? 17 (on MFM)

The capacity of this drive is : 44.660 MB or 44660224 KB

Now, you want to know what capacity the drive has if you would encode it 
in RLL !

How many Cylinders ? 733
How many Heads     ? 7
How many Sectors   ? 26 (on RLL)

The capacity of this drive is :68.303 MB or 68303872 KB



Installing:
-----------

Simply copy the Hd-calc into your PFiles dir and adopt it as an arexx file !

have fun !


